{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/1565","id":1533687709,"node_id":"PR_kwDOEFLz885bajed","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/1565","diff_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/1565.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/1565.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/1565","number":1565,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add Customization Options to DERP Map entry of integrated DERP server","user":{"login":"alexhalbi","id":5500720,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MDA3MjA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5500720?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexhalbi","html_url":"https://github.com/alexhalbi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexhalbi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexhalbi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexhalbi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexhalbi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexhalbi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexhalbi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexhalbi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexhalbi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexhalbi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"<!--\r\nHeadscale is \"Open Source, acknowledged contribution\", this means that any\r\ncontribution will have to be discussed with the Maintainers before being submitted.\r\n\r\nThis model has been chosen to reduce the risk of burnout by limiting the\r\nmaintenance overhead of reviewing and validating third-party code.\r\n\r\nHeadscale is open to code contributions for bug fixes without discussion.\r\n\r\nIf you find mistakes in the documentation, please submit a fix to the documentation.\r\n-->\r\nThis Pull request adds a draft for the possibility to add the IPv4 and IPv6 address to the DERP map for the integrated DERP server.\r\nThis enables the DERP server to be reachable by clients, if they are using an Exit-Node via the DERP server and loose DNS connection.\r\n\r\nThis happens for example when restarting Headscale and the Exit-Node on the same time. It is also possible that this happens if Headscale is restarted and one of the nodes, does not reconnect successfully to the integrated DERP server and tries to communicate DNS through it.\r\n\r\nIf you take a look into the [default derp map](https://login.tailscale.com/derpmap/default), all of them have their IPs in the list, the integrated DERP server does never have it's IP in the list.\r\nSee https://pkg.go.dev/tailscale.com/tailcfg#DERPNode for reference.\r\n\r\nFurthermore this request adds the possibility to disable the automatic creation of the integrated DERP map entry completely and adds the possibility to use the integrated DERP server with a completely custom etry in the `derp.paths`.\r\n\r\nThis enables even more customization, by fully leveraging the official [DERPRegion](https://pkg.go.dev/tailscale.com/tailcfg#DERPRegion) and [DERPNode](https://pkg.go.dev/tailscale.com/tailcfg#DERPNode) configuration file, which is currently overwriten.\r\nThis should also implement #1514.\r\n\r\nhttps://tailscale.com/kb/1118/custom-derp-servers/#step-2-adding-derp-servers-to-your-tailnet\r\n\r\n<!-- Please tick if the following things apply. You… -->\r\n\r\n- [X] read the [CONTRIBUTING guidelines](README.md#contributing)\r\n- [X] raised a GitHub issue or discussed it on the projects chat beforehand\r\n- [ ] added unit tests\r\n- [ ] added integration tests\r\n- [X] updated documentation if needed\r\n- [x] updated CHANGELOG.md\r\n\r\n<!-- If applicable, please reference the issue using `Fixes #XXX` and add tests to cover your new code. -->\r\n","created_at":"2023-09-28T08:25:54Z","updated_at":"2024-09-04T16:20:53Z","closed_at":"2024-01